1. default (trim is automatic): $show_arg(value = "  hi  ")
2. quoted (trim no-op, no surrounding ws): $show_arg_quoted(value=\"hi\")
3. keep_left_ws keeps the left side only: $show_arg_left(value = "  hi  ")
4. keep_right_ws (krws) keeps the right side only: $show_arg_right(value = "  hi  ")
5. keep_enclosing_ws keeps both sides: $show_arg_enclosing(value = "  hi  ")
6. keep_left_ws + keep_right_ws (klws+krws) == keep_enclosing_ws: $show_arg_aliases(value = "  hi  ")
7. call-site keep_left_ws on a positional arg: $show_raw_arg0(keep_left_ws "  hi  ")
8. call-site kws (alias) on a positional arg: $show_raw_arg0(kws "  hi  ")
9. named param: $show_params<name=world>
10. dup text: $repeat<count=3>(text=ab)
11. pick words: $select<unit=word,count=2>(text="alpha beta gamma delta")
12. fixed random: $uniform_dist<a=5,b=5,fmt=.0f>
